---
description: Repository-wide rules. Canonical source is AGENTS.md.
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repository root, plus the `AGENTS.md` of the workspace you edit. Key rules:

- Read existing code first and follow its pattern. Generate modules with `pnpm gen module <name>`.
- English only in code. No em dash (U+2014), no emoji.
- Every behavior change ships with tests. Verify with `pnpm verify` before declaring done.
- Conventional Commits with an allowed scope.
